      "id": "claim_d0aac87da0644087ab480ad01cfdd424",
      "statement": "`jef-data sync` loads a normalized, strictly validated universe, applies optional store, asset, provider, tail, force-actions, and dry-run inputs through `run_sync()`, renders universe or selection errors as `sync: ...`, and returns success only when the runner reports `ok`.",
