      "statement": "For collector legs, an empty series starts at the declared `start` floor while an existing series starts at the oldest of its newest `tail` stored sessions; declared crypto adds a previous-completed-UTC-day end guard, and a declared `end` remains a cap on both first-fill and tail requests.",
